# 换行与编码策略：仓库内所有文本文件统一 LF + UTF-8（无 BOM）。
# 禁止依赖各开发者本机 core.autocrlf / core.eol 的隐式转换；
# 变更后需运行 `git add --renormalize .` 一次性归一化基线。

* text=auto eol=lf

# 脚本按平台执行约定保留换行
*.sh text eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# 二进制产物禁止任何文本归一化，避免内容被改写
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.bmp binary
*.webp binary
*.svg text eol=lf
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.eot binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.tar binary
*.wasm binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.dylib binary
*.so binary
*.a binary
*.lib binary
*.pdb binary
